{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123761","id":4615297280,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABExfZAA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123761","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123761.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123761.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123761","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123761/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123761/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123761/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c7ac56f35dedc1e398db8af3f63318e951188b1f","number":123761,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[ObjectDB Profiler] Improve visualization of Inbound/Outbound References","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Changed colors to more easily understand where tables starts and ends.\r\n- When making a diff, in/Out references will be tinted green, red, or yellow when the object was added or removed to the list, relative to the same object in the other snapshot (this is not if the object itself was added removed or modified, is if the reference was added, deleted, or modified).\r\n- When a list of inbound or outbound references is empty, it will be not drawn at all.\r\n- **Depends on #123708**\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- The list of inbound/outbound objects was basically text in plain background color, maybe a side effect of when the promox theme was made the official theme, not sure if the theme was added before or after this UI. Anyway, now table is more readable\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Before:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1899\" height=\"850\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4225361a-3155-4cf7-ad12-1d47553086ef\" />\r\n\r\n### After:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14cf8cbd-b09c-4b48-b276-beb37c88e50b\r\n\r\n### After (Light Theme)\r\n<img width=\"1463\" height=\"555\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe6075e1-ea58-40a8-a270-2d085f90464e\" />\r\n\r\n## Known issue:\r\n\r\nChanging the theme while Inound/Outbound table is visible does not update the stylebox overrides\r\nThis issue existed before this PR, but now has extended to the title of the tables\r\n\r\n|master|this PR|\r\n|--|--|\r\n|<img width=\"393\" height=\"335\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e31c0cae-3f16-4401-b4dc-26055f9cafcf\" />|<img width=\"355\" height=\"481\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7593e11-2cd5-4dd2-886c-c4f774d6d435\" />|\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga